offee cup. Left arm is extended downward, holding a brown leather tote bag. Looking directly at the camera.\n*   **Top-Right Panel:** Model standing elegantly, hands resting lightly on her waist, looking straight ahead.\n*   **Bottom-Left Panel:** Model standing with weight shifted to one leg, right hand gently touching her hair, left arm resting at her side.\n*   **Bottom-Right Panel:** Model standing confidently, arms loosely crossed in front of her, looking slightly off-camera. \n\n**Negative Prompt:** Cropped, close-up, missing feet, missing shoes, cut off ankles, out of frame, different clothing, mismatched colors, altered clothing design, busy background."], "inputs": [{"name": "input", "link": 2254, "label": "input", "type": "*", "localized_name": "input"}, {"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "label": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mode"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1016, "type": "DisplayAny", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DisplayAny"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [2247], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "size": [210, 136], "pos": [11943.5625, 6178.3212890625], "widgets_values": ["width: 3584, height: 4800\n batch size: 15a8c01208e0cd9fda6ffcda62178b160"], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 2253, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 1015, "type": "GetImageSize", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.9.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "GetImageSize"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [440, 380], "pos": [11484.8154296875, 5905.3828125], "widgets_values": ["raw value", "让图1的模特穿上图2的